---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Endurance Grid Case Study · Phil Tarnowski" description="How I researched, designed, built, and launched Endurance Grid's website and iOS and Android apps with AI, driving $37K+ in race registrations." image="/og/endurance-grid.png">
<section style="background: #102A38">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 32px 56px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; align-items: center">
      <div style="flex: 1 1 440px; min-width: 0">
        <a href="https://www.endurancegrid.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 28px"><img src="/images/logo-endurance-grid.png" alt="Endurance Grid website" style="height: 48px; width: auto; display: block"></a>
        <h1 style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(40px, 4.4vw, 56px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: 0.005em; max-width: 16ch">From Idea to $37K in Race Registrations</h1>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #D8D8D8; max-width: 50ch">Endurance Grid helps people find a race, find their people, and train together. A <a href="https://www.endurancegrid.com/races" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #4AB8D4; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px">race calendar</a> and <a href="https://www.endurancegrid.com/community" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #4AB8D4; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px">community directory</a> for all 50 states, with supporting iOS and Android apps.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 36px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #D8D8D8; max-width: 50ch">I am the founder and lead product end to end: research, design, product strategy, an AI-native build, and go to market.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px"><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/id6815777574" style="display: inline-block; line-height: 0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/badge-app-store.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" style="height: 56px; width: 168px; display: block"></a><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.endurancegrid.app" aria-label="Get it on Google Play" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 56px; width: 186px; border-radius: 10px; line-height: 0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/badge-google-play.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; max-width: none; height: 82.35px; width: auto; top: -13.18px; left: -13.18px"></a></div>
        <p style="margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #7FA6B8">The best way to judge my product and design work is to use it.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1 1 440px; min-width: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start">
        <img src="/images/eg-training-calendar.webp" alt="The Endurance Grid training calendar" style="position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 52%; max-width: 290px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #26282E; border-radius: 42px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 96px">
        <img src="/images/eg-race-story.webp" alt="A Race Story in Endurance Grid" style="position: relative; z-index: 2; width: 52%; max-width: 290px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #33363D; border-radius: 42px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-left: -16%">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #102A38">
    <div class="stat-grid" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px clamp(40px, 5vw, 56px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 220px), 1fr)); gap: 16px">
      <div style="background: #163A4D; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1">$37K+</p><p style="margin: 14px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Registration volume</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #A9C2CE">From race pages, with no paid acquisition</p></div>
      <div style="background: #163A4D; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1">1,000+</p><p style="margin: 14px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Race registrations</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #A9C2CE">Driven through a race registration affiliate partnership</p></div>
      <div style="background: #163A4D; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1">2M+</p><p style="margin: 14px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Google search impressions</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #A9C2CE">25K+ clicks from organic SEO &amp; AEO</p></div>
      <div style="background: #163A4D; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1">850+</p><p style="margin: 14px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Workouts logged</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #A9C2CE">By training groups since the beta opened</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #1C1C1E">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">Our Founding Story</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0; max-width: 62ch">I built Endurance Grid to solve a problem I kept running into while training for these races with my wife, my brother, and our friends. Learn more about <a href="https://www.endurancegrid.com/our-story" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #4AB8D4; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px">our founding story</a>.</p>
      <div class="race-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr)); gap: 16px">
        <div style="background: #26282E; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #2E7D32; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Running</span><p style="margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">5× Half Marathons</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0">13.1 miles</p></div><div style="background: #26282E; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #2E7D32; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Running</span><p style="margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">Countless 5Ks + 4× Short Course Races</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0">10-Miler · 10K · 6-Miler</p></div><div style="background: #26282E; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #1B5E20; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Trail Running</span><p style="margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">1× Trail Half-Marathon</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0">13.1 miles</p></div><div style="background: #26282E; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #6A1B9A; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Triathlon</span><p style="margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">2× Triathlons</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0">Sprint</p></div><div style="background: #26282E; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #4A148C; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Duathlon</span><p style="margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">1× Duathlon</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0">Sprint</p></div><div style="background: #26282E; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #FFC107; color: #6D4F00; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">HYROX</span><p style="margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">2× HYROX Doubles</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0">Open · Pro</p></div><div style="background: #26282E; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #FFC107; color: #6D4F00; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">HYROX</span><p style="margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">2× HYROX Doubles Simulation Races</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0">Open</p></div><div style="background: #26282E; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #CC4800; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Road Cycling</span><p style="margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">1× Road Cycling Race</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0">12.5 miles</p></div><div style="background: #102A38; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: #4AB8D4">Credentials</p><p style="margin: 14px 0 6px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; color: #4AB8D4"><a href="https://www.nasm.org" class="hit" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: rgba(74, 184, 212, 0.45); text-underline-offset: 3px">NASM Certified</a></p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #A9C2CE">NASM-CPT · Stretching &amp; Flexibility · Sports Nutrition</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #EDEAE3; color: #1C1C1E">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">Inside the App</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #444444; max-width: 60ch">Find a race, see every state you have raced, plan the month, train in a group room built around a shared goal, get a recap every month and quarter, and keep the Race Story your group gets the day after.</p>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(max(130px, calc((100% - 72px) / 4)), 1fr)); gap: 32px 24px">
        <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-find-races.webp" alt="Find Races: search races by place, sport, state, and month" style="width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C1C1E; border-radius: 34px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center">Find Races</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-completed-races.webp" alt="Completed Races: a grid of all 50 states, filled in where you have raced" style="width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C1C1E; border-radius: 34px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center">Completed Races</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-training-calendar.webp" alt="The training calendar: a month of workouts by sport" style="width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C1C1E; border-radius: 34px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center">Training Calendar</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-my-grid.webp" alt="My Grid: every workout and race as a colored grid" style="width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C1C1E; border-radius: 34px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center">My Grid</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-group-room.webp" alt="A group room with a shared goal and workouts" style="width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C1C1E; border-radius: 34px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center">Group Room</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-monthly-recap.webp" alt="A monthly recap with a calendar of workouts and totals" style="width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C1C1E; border-radius: 34px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center">Monthly Recap</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-quarterly-recap.webp" alt="A quarterly recap for a training group" style="width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C1C1E; border-radius: 34px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center">Group Quarterly Recap</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-race-story.webp" alt="A Race Story the day after the race" style="width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C1C1E; border-radius: 34px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center">Race Story</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid #CFCCC3">
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1">A Brand With Characters</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #444444; max-width: 62ch">I designed the brand to have a family of four mascots. Consumer apps need personality to feel different than what is out there. I designed them to help users have fun, while getting used to app functionality like welcoming new group members, celebrating finish lines, or workout summaries. <a href="https://www.endurancegrid.com/mascots" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #1A6E86; font-weight: 600">Meet the mascots →</a></p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 240px), 1fr)); gap: 16px">
        <figure style="margin: 0; background: #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden">
          <img src="/images/mascot-chip-time.svg" alt="Chip Time, the guide mascot, at home in the freezer" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block">
          <figcaption style="padding: 16px 20px; color: #FFFFFF"><span style="display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Chip Time · The guide</span><span style="display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #C8D6DD">"That's cold."</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; background: #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden">
          <img src="/images/mascot-pain-gwyn.svg" alt="Pain Gwyn the penguin waddling up to a finish line" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block">
          <figcaption style="padding: 16px 20px; color: #FFFFFF"><span style="display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Pain Gwyn · The celebrator</span><span style="display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #C8D6DD">"Waddle on."</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; background: #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden">
          <img src="/images/mascot-the-old-block.svg" alt="The Old Block on a glacier next to a wall of ice blocks" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block">
          <figcaption style="padding: 16px 20px; color: #FFFFFF"><span style="display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">The Old Block · Recaps</span><span style="display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #C8D6DD">"Keep building, block by block."</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure style="margin: 0; background: #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden">
          <img src="/images/mascot-grid-ole.svg" alt="Grid Ole the griddle cooking on a Sunday morning" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block">
          <figcaption style="padding: 16px 20px; color: #FFFFFF"><span style="display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Grid Ole · Streaks</span><span style="display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #C8D6DD">"Keep cooking!"</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">The Product Decisions</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0; max-width: 62ch">The product, design, and go-to-market calls behind it.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px 40px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #26282E">
          <p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 72px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1">01</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 300px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1">Launch the Website First</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; flex: 999 1 360px; min-width: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0">A race calendar for all 50 states, sport guides, and a sport quiz, with 15K+ race listings kept current by nightly syncs. This created traffic, assets to use later, and a way to get feedback before I built the app.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px 40px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #26282E">
          <p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 72px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1">02</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 300px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1">Recruit a Beta Group Before Launch</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; flex: 999 1 360px; min-width: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0">A Founding Athletes campaign brought in 19 early adopters who paid and agreed to give feedback. I ran the outreach, release notes, surveys, and interviews.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px 40px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #26282E">
          <p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 72px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1">03</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 300px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1">Learn From What People Use</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; flex: 999 1 360px; min-width: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0">Talked to users and studied PostHog analytics to see what people use, what they're trying to accomplish, and how to make their experience better. That showed which tools they use today, where we fit, and how to double down on what makes us different.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px 40px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #26282E; border-bottom: 1px solid #26282E">
          <p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 72px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1">04</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 300px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1">Test Revenue &amp; Cut What Didn't Work</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; flex: 999 1 360px; min-width: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0">Kept investing in the affiliate revenue that works, cut travel booking after a 0.04% click-through rate, and launched in-app ads with a paid ad-free option.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #1C1C1E">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">How I Built With AI</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0; max-width: 62ch">AI changes how fast a product moves, not what good product work looks like. This is the workflow behind the website and both apps.</p>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 200px), 1fr)); gap: 12px">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; border-top: 6px solid #4AB8D4">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; color: #1E7E96">1</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05">Research and Design</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #444444">Define the most valuable problem to solve and create a clickable design. Iterate and test that with beta users before anything is built.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; border-top: 6px solid #4AB8D4">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; color: #1E7E96">2</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05">Scope a Thin Slice</h3>
